ters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"스크린을 배포한 정부의 속셈은 사실 대국민 감시 장치를 전국에 설치하기 위함일세.\r","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"우연히 스크린 불량품을 수리하던 엔지니어를 만난 적이 있는데, \n\n스크린에는 도청장치가 탑재되어 있다고 하더군.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"카메라, 도청 장치.\r\n\n이게 어떤 의미를 가질지는 자네도 잘 알겠지?","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"그래서 내가 지금 스크린을 막고 자네에게 이 문서로 대화를 하는 걸세.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"정부는 반동분자를 색출하고, 불온한 생각을 가진 국민들을 찾아 족치려는\n \n목적으로 이 스크린을 배포한 것이라고 생각을 하네.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"아무래도 더 킹은 아슬라니아 전 국민의 자유를 박탈시키려 하고 있어.\r\n\r\n스크린이 도입되면서 바뀐 자네의 업무들도 마찬가지야.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"왜 자네는 문서의 정보를 수정하고 있나?\r\n\r\n그건. 바로 정부가 국민들을 속이기 위해 멋대로 과거의 내용을 수정하는 작업을 하는거야.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"눈 가리고 아웅이라고? 난 그렇게 생각하지 않아.\r\n\r\n어차피 대중들은 눈에 보이는 정보를 먼저 믿지.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"대부분의 국민들은 당장 내일 신문에 쌀 생산량이 지난해에 비해 30% 상승했다고 보도하면 믿을 걸세.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"몇몇 국민들이 이 수치에 의심을 품는다 하더라도, 자네들이 이미 과거의 정보를 \n수정한 뒤이기 때문에, 정보들을 비교해 본 뒤 수치가 맞게 떨어진다면 자신의 \n기억이 잘못되었다고 생각하고 넘어갈 것이야.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"그런 식으로 국민들을 기만하는 거지.\r\n\r\n정보를 수정하는 자네들도 그저 ‘오타’라는 명목하에 수정을 하니 이런 속임수에 넘어가는 것이지.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"그러니, 자네도 혹시 모를 상황에 잘 대비하길 바라네.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"Paper","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"","talkerInfo":"","text":"클레이튼은 다시 문서를 서류 봉투에 넣었다.","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":null,"index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Henderson","index":0,"isHighlight":false}]},"background":"none","isFade":false},{"$type":"TalkParagraph, Assembly-CSharp","talker":"클레이튼","talkerInfo":"정보 1반 반장","text":"뭡니까? 이 두서 없는 호의는?","fontSize":"normal","textDelay":0.4,"sfxDelay":0.6,"bgm":"none","action":"none","actionParam":"","characters":{"$type":"CharacterCG[], Assembly-CSharp","$values":[{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileName":"Klayton","index":0,"isHighlight":false},{"$type":"CharacterCG, Assembly-CSharp","fileNam